 Access Pass: $250 Virtual-Only Pass: $60 AFF30 will open Thursday\, Novemb
 er 5 at AMC Kabuki in San Francisco with Marwan Hamed ’s El Sett \, a sw
 eeping cinematic portrait of legendary Egyptian singer Umm Kulthum \, star
 ring Mona Zaki . Celebrated Egyptian producer Mohamed Hefzy will be honore
 d on Opening Night with the inaugural AFMI Luminary Award for Cultural Imp
 act and will attend as a special guest. AFF30 will also feature a special 
